19. this keyword tricky
        const obj = {
          name: "Amir",
          normal() {
            console.log(this.name);
          },
          arrow: () => {
            console.log(this.name);
          }
        };

        obj.normal();
        obj.arrow();
    Answer:
        Amir
        undefined

20. bind/call/apply
        function greet() {
          console.log(this.name);
        }

        const user = { name: "Amir" };

        greet.call(user);
    Answer:
        ✅ Output: Amir

21. Object mutation
        const person = { name: "A" };
        const p2 = person;
        p2.name = "B";
        console.log(person.name);
    Answer:
        ✅ Output: "B"
        Both refer same object.

22. Spread copy
        const obj1 = { a: 1 };
        const obj2 = { ...obj1 };
        obj2.a = 5;
        console.log(obj1.a);
    Answer:
        ✅ Output: 1
        Spread makes shallow copy.

23. Deep copy fail
        const a = { x: { y: 1 } };
        const b = { ...a };
        b.x.y = 99;
        console.log(a.x.y);
    Answer:
        ✅ Output: 99
        Because spread is shallow.

24. Map vs Object key
        const map = new Map();
        map["a"] = 1;
        map.set("b", 2);
        console.log(map["a"]);
        console.log(map.get("b"));
    Answer:
        1
        2
    But map["a"] is not real map storage.

25. Delete operator trick
        let x = 10;
        console.log(delete x);
    Answer:
        ✅ Output: false
        delete works only on object properties.